# Firebase project / environment diagnostic
#
# Dev API  -> citylife-fe75a        (see .env.dev)
# Prod API -> nuernbergspots-b460a   (see .env.prd)
#
# Expected matrix:
#   dev token  + /dev  -> 200 (or 403 on admin-only routes)
#   dev token  + /prd  -> 401 Authentication failed
#   prd token  + /dev  -> 401 Authentication failed
#   prd token  + /prd  -> 200 (or 403 on admin-only routes)
#
# API keys: copy FIREBASE_API_KEY from .env.dev / .env.prd below.

@baseUrlDev = https://nuernbergspots.de/dev
@baseUrlPrd = https://nuernbergspots.de/prd
@firebaseApiKeyDev = YOUR_DEV_FIREBASE_API_KEY
@firebaseApiKeyPrd = YOUR_PRD_FIREBASE_API_KEY
@devToken = YOUR_DEV_ID_TOKEN
@prdToken = YOUR_PRD_ID_TOKEN

### 1) Get anonymous token from DEV Firebase (citylife-fe75a)
# @name devAnonymousToken
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key={{firebaseApiKeyDev}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### 2) Get anonymous token from PRD Firebase (nuernbergspots-b460a)
# @name prdAnonymousToken
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key={{firebaseApiKeyPrd}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnSecureToken": true
}

### 3) Baseline: no auth (both envs should return 401)
GET {{baseUrlDev}}/app-settings

###
GET {{baseUrlPrd}}/app-settings

### 4) DEV token against DEV API (should work)
GET {{baseUrlDev}}/app-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

### 5) DEV token against PRD API (should fail with 401 Authentication failed)
GET {{baseUrlPrd}}/app-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

### 6) PRD token against DEV API (should fail with 401 Authentication failed)
GET {{baseUrlDev}}/app-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{prdToken}}

### 7) PRD token against PRD API (should work)
GET {{baseUrlPrd}}/app-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{prdToken}}

### 8) Bootstrap cold-start check (same matrix)
GET {{baseUrlDev}}/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrlPrd}}/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrlDev}}/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{prdToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrlPrd}}/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{prdToken}}
